Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:11.60,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(60,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFPOP1W5-GB\frz-90\1a&H00&}沉醉此刻自己描绘的梦境
