Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:27.03,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(60,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFPOP1W5-GB\frz-90\1a&H00&}还有一件件回忆都珍藏宝箱里
